title: Military Affairs
subtitle: Civilian control of the army: oversight, lawful changes of personnel, or a limited reform.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/map_3.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'military_policy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.military_policy (technical reference 16.3, 17.12.4; card catalogue 8.14): one project of civilian
// control for the one synthetic post over the near reserve. Preparing it costs this month's action, its launch in
// the agenda another; its effects come once per scope of the reform.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'military_policy');
!}

= Military affairs

The post and its scope are a marked synthetic function over one group of the army; the historical appointments are not reconstructed. A compromise that gives Piłsudski personal powers goes through the agreement with him, not through this card.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @civilian_oversight
- @personnel_changes
- @organizational_compromise
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@civilian_oversight
title: Prepare full civilian oversight
subtitle: A law with army +2, then 1 B for three months; after it the group gains +0.05 of loyalty to the legal authorities.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'military_policy', 'civilian_oversight').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_military_policy_civilian_oversight_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'military_policy', 'civilian_oversight');
!}
go-to: result

@personnel_changes
title: Prepare lawful changes of personnel
subtitle: The same project with a named nomination: +0.05 legal loyalty, the group's readiness −0.05 for two months, and a real conflict raises the pressure.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'military_policy', 'personnel_changes').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_military_policy_personnel_changes_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'military_policy', 'personnel_changes');
!}
go-to: result

@organizational_compromise
title: Prepare an organisational compromise limiting the reform
subtitle: A law with army 0, then 1 B for two months; the group gains +0.025 of legal loyalty.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'military_policy', 'organizational_compromise').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_military_policy_organizational_compromise_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'military_policy', 'organizational_compromise');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

